From f83394c6828d146d9fb9e17913251a498a5deced Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:34:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] env: integrate BPI-R4 Pro recovery policy

Enable and connect the final Production, USB, TFTP, Local, Web Rescue, button, persistent-crash, LED, and automatic recovery behavior across SD, eMMC, and SPI-NAND.

Probe USB, TFTP, and Local before selecting the fixed USB to TFTP to Local priority. Keep automatic and selected-source modes waiting indefinitely and route every loaded image through the common bounded validator.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
